    )
    (property "Note" "The tester pull-up. ISO 9141-2 names 510 ohm; 750 is what exists in 1206 and it is the better number here anyway -- the value is not critical, the ECU provides the real pull-up, and 750 dissipates 12^2/750 = 190 mW while the line is dominant against 510's 280 mW, which a 1206 rated 250 mW could not have carried" (at 81.28 159.26 0)
      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left) hide)
    )
